# Build context for deploy/web.Dockerfile only (BuildKit uses it instead of the root .dockerignore): an allowlist.
# Never in the context: .env and other secrets, var/ (the SQLite store), .venv/, data/, audio, models (AGENTS.md rule 7),
# and the local web/node_modules and web/dist (npm ci and the build run inside the image).
*
!web/
!deploy/nginx.conf
!deploy/nginx_security_headers.conf
web/node_modules
web/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Listed for readers; already excluded by the first line.
**/.env
**/.env.*
var/
.venv/
data/
**/*.wav
**/*.flac
**/*.mp3
